  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      I keep this site as a quiet place to think out loud.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of it gets written late at night—sometimes in English, sometimes in Bahasa Indonesia—whenever a thought won't leave my head until I write it down into sentences.
    </p>

    <p>
      No publication schedule, no fixed genre, and no grand conclusions. Just an open notebook.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, static HTML/CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, ads, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New essays are published via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
